    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29735" root="عفر" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَافِرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْعَفِرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْفُورٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَفَّرٌ</span></b>  <i>Defiled
with dust:</i> hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَافِرُ الوَجْهِ</span> <i>He whose face is
defiled with dust:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَجْهِ فِى التُّرَابِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مُنْعَفِرُ</span></b> ,
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَفَّرُهُ</span></b> , <i>He has the face defiled in the dust.</i>
(TA.)

